{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、\n今年初握手会\nにして\n16thラスト全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪が降ってる中\n来てくださってありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブ\n本当に後ろまで\nたくさんの方が来てくださいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影ナレは\n蘭世と中田でやらせていただきましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の影ナレでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は\n愛未と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未とは何回か一緒のレーンになってるからなのか\n共通点があるからなのか\nわかりませんけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未推しは知ってる方が\nたくさんいたように思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n髪を切ったと聞いて\n急遽、来てくださったかたも\nたくさんいましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速ボブ効果あり。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん来てくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中何時間も待った方が多いと思うので\nみなさんお風呂でゆっくり暖まってくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は同じ場所で個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月はどう過ごした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/01/14/9658832/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、何か大きい決断をした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}